[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華だったのか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00107",
    "bgm": "041"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002010010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うげ、見つかっちゃったー……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700201/1007002010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近、事務所の掃除とか備品の管理とか買い置きの確認とか\r\n細々した仕事をやれてないなと思ったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……気付いて先回りしてくれてたんだな……！\r\nありがとう……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002010020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いや、別に……三峰だけってわけでもないからね\r\nきりりんとか日頃から普通に気にかけてくれてることだし",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700201/1007002010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002010030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰は今回たまたま！　そろそろお茶菓子を\r\n補充しといた方がいいかなーって思っただけなので",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700201/1007002010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002010040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "お礼はもっと他の方々に言ってあげてください",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700201/1007002010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、他のみんなにもお礼は言う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、今回の結華の一回にだって俺は助けられたんだ\r\nだから感謝を伝えないなんてことはしないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それに、結華がそういう言い方をする時は\r\n他にも何か隠してる時だ。さすがにわかる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近みんな忙しくしてるから、色々気を遣ってくれたんだろ\r\n……本当に、ありがとうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002010050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700201/1007002010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002010060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "Ｐたんはさぁ……\r\n人の繊細なところを遠慮なくぶち抜いてくるよねぇ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700201/1007002010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002010070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰がなんでこっそりやろうとしてたか、\r\n考えてくれた～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700201/1007002010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやっ、でも……！　いいことをしてくれたんだから、\r\n正当に感謝されるべきだろう……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002010080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まったく～、この善良まっしぐらなＰたんめ～",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700201/1007002010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002010090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "微妙な乙女心を解してくれない悪い子は、\r\nほっぺでもつねっちゃおうかな～？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700201/1007002010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ま、待ってくれ結華！\r\nそれはなしだろ……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002010100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はーあ、プロデューサーってば本当に真っ直ぐ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700201/1007002010100"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "yuika",
